{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-ea1fc67c19d08d62ee7c","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"벽 통과 기술을 드디어 터득했어! 이제 나도 {RUBY_B#야누스}「양문」{RUBY_E#}의 사제야, 윙~","speaker":"벽 통과 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18172010942447667109"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16596360222090758435"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-75528bf7a56120808bf0","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"어떻게 이 안에 들어가 있는 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2579523935265755851"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-40f5766a942ce427317a","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"헤헤, 이게 바로 벽 통과 기술이지! 하지만 지금 위치가 완벽하지는 않네. 조금만 움직일게~","speaker":"벽 통과 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["613807173647349816"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16596360222090758435"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-aaf9f9bab681942884fd","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"지금 날개만 삐져나와 있는데?","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14324955218257188560"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-465a74730face5a4698c","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"이, 이 기술을 익힌 지 얼마 안 돼서 그래! 조금만 움직일게……","speaker":"벽 통과 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2057252430146731254"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16596360222090758435"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-5667d87b5e849be492cb","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"후~ 됐다, 이제 벽을 완벽하게 통과했어, 윙","speaker":"벽 통과 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14587484048469572496"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16596360222090758435"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a6fa8684a723eea72ba7","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","text":"비밀 하나 알려줄게. 「양문」은 사실 문이 두 개만 있는 게 아니라, 셀 수 없이 많아! 물론 나는 아직 세 개 달린 것밖에 본 적 없지만……","speaker":"벽 통과 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"벽 통과 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4892754899845061212"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16596360222090758435"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-ea1fc67c19d08d62ee7c","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-ea1fc67c19d08d62ee7c","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","scene":"벽 통과 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-1e421c7d88fff8843ff99747","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[2,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-75528bf7a56120808bf0","other-interaction-p15862-aaf9f9bab681942884fd"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-75528bf7a56120808bf0","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-75528bf7a56120808bf0","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","scene":"벽 통과 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-1e421c7d88fff8843ff99747","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[2,1,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["696b69fccc5a-0"],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-40f5766a942ce427317a","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-40f5766a942ce427317a","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sfa38755b60ec23e6","scene":"벽 통과 나비","contex